    Bug 1913741 - Enbolden the sender in unread cards. r=vineet,Paenglab,micahilbery


    For unread messages, the sender should also be bold in addition to the subject.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D219545

diff --git a/mail/themes/shared/mail/threadCard.css b/mail/themes/shared/mail/threadCard.css
index 118775ad127..671376e6557 100644
--- a/mail/themes/shared/mail/threadCard.css
+++ b/mail/themes/shared/mail/threadCard.css
@@ -110,7 +110,7 @@
       --read-status-fill: var(--color-green-40);
       --read-status-stroke: var(--color-green-60);

-      & :is(.sender, .subject) {
+      & .card-container :is(.sender, .subject) {
         font-weight: bold;
       }
